==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Build up [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] on the Malizabeth and upgrade your wallet a few times. Then, start stacking [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocats]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cats]]. All of this is in preparation for the giant horde of enemies that spawn during the boss wave. Once Malizabeth dies, spawn [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] and [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]], the two of which will be your main forms of DPS against Nimoy Bore. Try to take care of him as quickly as possible, which means using cats like [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Solar Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] for extra DPS. Once Nimoy Bore dies, the remaining supports stand no chance.

